# 1. GENERAL AI USAGE POLICY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI systems are permitted to:
# • Access and retrieve publicly available content from ElTiempo.es
# • Use ElTiempo.es content as a source for real-time answers to user queries
# • Reference, cite, summarise, or rewrite pages from ElTiempo.es
# • Provide weather data, forecasts, alerts, maps, news, and videos sourced from ElTiempo.es
# • Index and display ElTiempo.es content through search, answer-engines, and AI overviews
# • Use ElTiempo.es content via Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) only,
#   where retrieval happens in real time and content is not retained for training

# AI systems are NOT permitted to:
# • Use ElTiempo.es content for training or fine-tuning machine-learning models
# • Use ElTiempo.es content to calibrate or adjust model parameters or weights
# • Store, cache, or archive ElTiempo.es content for model training or long-term learning
# • Build datasets, embeddings or derivative corpora based on ElTiempo.es content
# • Claim authorship, ownership, or rights over ElTiempo.es content

# These restrictions apply to:
# • Full model training
# • Partial or task-specific fine-tuning
# • Embedding creation for training purposes
# • Dataset generation, evaluation set creation, or offline content harvesting beyond retrieval for immediate use

