# 2. SITE PURPOSE & MISSION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ElTiempo.es is Spain’s leading digital weather portal, offering forecasts and meteorological information for hundreds of thousands of cities and regions worldwide. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}
#
# Our mission is to empower users—individuals, travellers, businesses and communities—with accurate, timely and accessible weather data, radars, alerts, and climate-related news.
#
# ElTiempo.es provides:
# • Current weather conditions (temperature, humidity, wind, pressure, visibility)
# • Hourly, short-term and extended forecasts for cities and regions globally
# • Severe weather alerts, storm-tracking, lightning detection and radar/satellite maps
# • Weather news, climate change features, environmental insights and lifestyle-weather content
# • Specialized verticals such as travel weather, road/travel disruptions, pollen/allergy forecasts
#
# ElTiempo.es values:
# • Scientific accuracy and meteorological integrity
# • User-centric design and actionable insights
# • Broad geographic reach with local detail
# • Clear and trustworthy communication

